Absolutely. For Senior Java/Spring Boot interviews, you should prepare this as one connected topic rather than memorizing annotations independently:

Spring Container → Bean scopes → Bean lifecycle → Dependency Injection → Auto-configuration → Spring Boot → REST → Data/JPA →
